<section class="section"><div class="shell prose"><div class="policy-banner">MANAGEMENT REVIEW REQUIRED BEFORE PUBLICATION</div><h2>What this draft covers</h2><p>This notice should explain what information East Sussex Roofing collects through quote and contact routes, why it is used, how long it is kept, who receives it, and how people can raise a request.</p><h2>Details still required</h2><ul><li>Controller name and contact address.</li><li>Privacy contact email.</li><li>Form provider, hosting recipients, and storage locations.</li><li>Retention periods and rights process.</li><li>ICO registration details, if applicable.</li></ul><p>Do not treat this draft as the site’s final privacy notice. See the <a href="/accessibility/">accessibility statement draft</a> and the <a href="/terms/">website terms draft</a>.</p></div></section>
